cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ASA-RV3D, please cite the associated manuscript and this repository."
title: "ASA-RV3D: Constrained Post-Partition Refinement for RISC-V 3-D Tier Partitioning"
authors:
  - family-names: Duan
    given-names: Hongyuan
version: 1.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-07
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hongyuan-mees/ASA-RV3D"
abstract: "ASA-RV3D is a constrained post-partition refinement framework for two-tier RISC-V gate-level partitioning. It starts from native timing-aware TritonPart assignments and uses normalized physical, timing, and optional recovered design-context information under explicit feasibility guards."
license: BSD-3-Clause
